SUMMARY:Josh Wolf: Touring Hard LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DTSTAMP:20260812T042858Z
DTSTART:20260813T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nJosh Wolf is a veteran stand-up comedian\, actor\, and television per
	sonality best known as a longtime panelist on Chelsea Lately on E! Network
	. With over two decades of experience in comedy\, Wolf has built a reputat
	ion as one of the most consistently funny and relatable performers on the 
	road today. \nHis stand-up style is rooted in real life — marriage\, fathe
	rhood\, and the beautiful chaos of raising a family. Josh has a gift for t
	urning everyday frustrations into laugh-out-loud moments that resonate wit
	h audiences of all ages. His storytelling is warm\, honest\, and genuinely
	 hilarious. \nThe Touring Hard show is Josh Wolf’s latest live comedy tour
	\, bringing his best material and new stories to clubs and theaters across
	 the country. Houston is lucky to have him at the intimate Punch Line stag
	e. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Do
	ors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline St
	reet\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ (2 Beverage Minimum per pe
	rson)\nTicket Prices: $38 – $50 (fees included)\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunch 
	Line Houston is the go-to comedy club in downtown Houston\, situated at 12
	04 Caroline Street. This Live Nation venue is known for bringing top-tier 
	national comedians to an intimate\, club-style setting that puts you close
	 to the action. \nThe general admission layout means you can find a great 
	spot anywhere in the room\, with preferred seating upgrades available for 
	those who want the best views. The full bar keeps the drinks flowing\, and
	 the 2-beverage minimum per person is part of the club experience. \nValet
	 parking is available at most shows. The Green Street garage on Clay betwe
	en Main and Fannin provides additional parking with convenient skybridge a
	ccess. The venue is cashless — all major credit and debit cards accepted. 
	\nWhat to Expect\nJosh Wolf’s Touring Hard show is a masterclass in relata
	ble comedy. Expect a full evening of polished stand-up that covers family 
	life\, relationships\, and the hilarious realities of getting older. Wolf’
	s natural charisma and crowd connection make every show feel unique. \nThe
	 Thursday night show kicks off at 7:30 PM\, with doors opening at 6:30 PM.
	 Additional shows are available Friday August 14 and Saturday August 15 fo
	r those who can’t make the Thursday performance. The show runs approximate
	ly 90 minutes. \nRemember: no cell phones\, no recording\, and no heckling
	. Just sit back\, relax\, and enjoy one of the best stand-up comedians wor
	king today. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $38 for general admissi
	on and up to $50 for preferred seating (all-in pricing\, fees included bef
	ore taxes). Secure your seats through Ticketmaster or browse resale option
	s on VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains aff
	iliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps:/
	/comedycalendar.com/event/josh-wolf-touring-hard-live-at-punch-line-housto
	n/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-wolf-touring-hard-live-at-punch-l
	ine-houston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\,
	 United States
